==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Tackey]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Selena]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Chocolate Doge]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Some good rushers like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and [[Talents|Talented]] [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T.]] will make handling the Chocolate Doge a lot easier, however you can also use it as platform to snipe Selena with [[Long Distance]] units such as [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]]. Make sure to bring a [[Wave Shield]] like [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] if you decide to do this.

Once Chocolate Doge is dead, feel free to use [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] with [[Cat Combo]]s to stunlock Selena. Tackey will continuously try and snipe your units, so try to limit your options to either melee rushers or tanky backliners.

